    {"id": "Q5", "text": "How does the endorsement or criticism of specific political figures (e.g., Biden) influence an individual’s expressed support for third-party alternatives and their predicted voting behavior in the 2028 U.S. presidential election?"},
    {"id": "Q6", "text": "To what degree does the promotion of non-voting as a form of protest correlate with an individual’s underlying political ideology and their predicted voting preference in the 2028 U.S. presidential election?"}
  ]
}

